问题：In the diagram, $RSP$ is a straight line and $\angle QSP = 80^\circ$.  What is the measure of $\angle PQR$, in degrees?

[asy]
draw((.48,-.05)--(.48,.05)); draw((.52,-.05)--(.52,.05)); draw((1.48,-.05)--(1.48,.05)); draw((1.52,-.05)--(1.52,.05));

