问题：What is the coefficient of $x^3$ in the expansion of $$(x+2\sqrt3)^7?$$
答案：33792 \sqrt{3}
解决方案：The binomial theorem tells us that
\begin{align}
(x + y)^n = \sum_{k=0}^n \binom{n}{k} x^k y^{n-k}.
