问题：Triangle $ABC$, $ADE$, and $EFG$ are all equilateral. Points $D$ and $G$ are midpoints of $\overline{AC}$ and $\overline{AE}$, respectively. If $AB=4$, what is the perimeter of figure $ABCDEFG$? [asy]
