\begin{tabular}{rccccccccc}
$n=0$:& & & & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
$n=1$:& & & & 1 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
$n=2$:& & & 1 & & 2 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
$n=3$:& & 1 & & 3 & & 3 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
$n=4$:& 1 & & 4 & & 6 & & 4 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
& & & & & $\vdots$ & & & &

\end{tabular}
答案：\log_2 N
解决方案：Let $a_0,a_1,a_2,\cdots,a_n$ denote the nth row of the Pascal triangle.
Then $\log_{10} \sum\limits_{k=0}^n a_k$ = $\log_{10} \sum\limits_{k=0}^n {n\choose k}$.
As $M^{N-1} = \sum\limits_{k=0}^n {n\choose k}$, $\log_{10} \sum\limits_{k=0}^n {n\choose k} = N-1$.
Hence, $\frac{f(n)}{\log_{10} 2}$ = $\frac{N-1}{\log_{10} 2}$ = $\boxed{\log_2 N}$.

